WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:41.640
Handsome,

01:43.080 --> 01:44.400
can I borrow something?

01:45.120 --> 01:47.640
Pretty, what do you need?

01:59.280 --> 02:00.360
You can't take pictures like this.

02:10.240 --> 02:11.080
You did it on purpose.

02:11.160 --> 02:12.400
Stop!

02:15.400 --> 02:16.280
Take him to the car.

02:18.840 --> 02:20.320
- Are you okay?
- I'm fine.

02:20.400 --> 02:22.600
We received a call and came to assist you.

02:32.280 --> 02:33.160
There's evidence

02:33.800 --> 02:35.120
of stalking and intentional harm.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.200
That's a relief.

02:38.280 --> 02:40.120
The criminal evidence is captured.

02:40.200 --> 02:41.680
Thanks for your cooperation.

03:02.880 --> 03:03.840
Long time no see…

03:05.040 --> 03:06.080
Su Miao.

03:15.600 --> 03:16.920
You can see me now?

03:18.000 --> 03:19.040
Clearly.

03:21.720 --> 03:23.000
Your eyes are better?

03:23.600 --> 03:24.880
You can see now.

03:26.200 --> 03:27.120
That's great.

03:29.880 --> 03:31.560
Aren't you supposed to explain this to me?

03:37.360 --> 03:38.200
Well…

03:41.000 --> 03:44.320
I came back to life for a reason.

03:44.400 --> 03:45.360
I know.

03:46.200 --> 03:47.160
It's the same reason

03:48.200 --> 03:50.240
with Fang Jin and Quan Shengtang's death.

03:51.560 --> 03:52.640
It's all fake.

03:59.720 --> 04:00.560
You…

04:01.400 --> 04:03.560
When did your vision return?

04:04.360 --> 04:06.320
The day Quan Shengtang
died in the accident.

04:08.200 --> 04:10.200
I found out the blood was a film prop.

04:11.080 --> 04:12.520
In the household registration system,

04:14.080 --> 04:15.040
Su Miao,

04:15.920 --> 04:16.959
Quan Shengtang,

04:17.560 --> 04:18.560
and Granny Quan…

04:20.040 --> 04:21.480
There's no data on them.

04:26.560 --> 04:27.400
That means…

04:29.320 --> 04:31.200
It didn't cause your blindness.

04:32.000 --> 04:34.360
- Your eyes…
- My eyes didn't go blind.

04:36.400 --> 04:37.720
I saw everything.

04:38.600 --> 04:41.000
You saw everything?

04:44.160 --> 04:45.000
I…

04:48.440 --> 04:50.480
Su Miao. Su Miao.

04:51.280 --> 04:52.440
Su Chengcheng!

04:56.440 --> 04:57.360
You're running again.

05:05.600 --> 05:07.320
Let me see where you can run to this time.

05:39.720 --> 05:41.840
At least eat something.

05:41.920 --> 05:43.280
It's all your favorite.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.720
I can't eat.

05:45.840 --> 05:48.080
I don't know how to face Tang Qi.

05:48.160 --> 05:50.400
I want to quit my job.
I want to disappear completely.

05:52.120 --> 05:53.640
Didn't you say before

05:54.360 --> 05:56.160
that as long as Tang Qi's eyes
can be cured,

05:56.240 --> 05:57.400
you'd confess everything?

05:58.040 --> 06:00.200
Actually, the result now

06:00.280 --> 06:02.520
is pretty much what you expected.

06:02.600 --> 06:04.240
It's just that the process

06:07.360 --> 06:09.400
deviated a little.

06:09.480 --> 06:11.720
A little?

06:11.800 --> 06:14.200
That's like going from Earth to Mars.

06:23.680 --> 06:27.560
TANG QI

06:27.640 --> 06:29.040
You've been lying to me for so long.

06:29.800 --> 06:32.040
Don't you think you owe me an explanation?

06:33.280 --> 06:36.400
I'll wait for you.

06:36.480 --> 06:39.600
I'll wait for you.

06:39.680 --> 06:45.720
I'll wait for you.

07:11.880 --> 07:12.880
Tang Qi.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.360
How should I address you?

07:35.120 --> 07:36.120
Su Miao?

07:37.000 --> 07:37.840
Fang Jin?

07:38.400 --> 07:39.240
Quan Shengtang?

07:40.880 --> 07:41.720
Or…

07:43.680 --> 07:44.520
Granny Quan?

07:45.960 --> 07:46.800
Sorry.

07:48.000 --> 07:50.240
I didn't mean to deceive you.

07:56.480 --> 07:57.920
Who was the first person you became?

08:53.440 --> 08:54.280
Sorry.

09:10.800 --> 09:11.960
After Su Miao died,

09:15.880 --> 09:17.160
you became Fang Jin.

09:20.400 --> 09:21.560
Yes.

09:45.600 --> 09:47.200
No wonder the weak Fang Jin

09:49.200 --> 09:50.920
suddenly beat up Guan Shengyu.

09:52.880 --> 09:53.720
Sorry.

10:05.720 --> 10:07.880
Then you became Quan Shengtang.

10:43.360 --> 10:44.800
To reject me,

10:46.240 --> 10:47.840
you really went to great lengths.

10:48.880 --> 10:50.000
Sorry.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.280
Except for Granny Quan,

11:03.320 --> 11:05.440
did you change into anyone else
to deceive me?

11:07.200 --> 11:08.040
No.

11:15.440 --> 11:18.920
It's not human, but…

11:20.240 --> 11:21.080
What?

11:29.600 --> 11:30.480
Sorry.

11:33.000 --> 11:34.000
Sure enough.

11:36.320 --> 11:38.760
The alpaca at the zoo
wasn't the one from my home.

11:46.040 --> 11:47.160
Sorry.

11:47.960 --> 11:49.920
I don't know how it turned out like this.

11:50.480 --> 11:52.120
One wrong step led to another,

11:52.920 --> 11:54.800
and now it's like this.

11:55.920 --> 11:57.800
It's so unbelievable

11:57.880 --> 11:59.920
that I don't know
how to explain it to you.

12:00.000 --> 12:03.400
I thought about telling you,
but I didn't have the courage.

12:03.480 --> 12:05.120
I'm really sorry.

12:13.280 --> 12:14.120
Sorry.

12:15.880 --> 12:17.760
I didn't mean to deceive you.

12:23.280 --> 12:25.280
That's right.

12:27.440 --> 12:29.760
I shouldn't have liked Su Miao
and Fang Jin.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.680
They'd always been avoiding me,

12:35.000 --> 12:36.480
but I kept bothering them.

12:47.080 --> 12:47.920
Alright.

12:50.160 --> 12:51.800
It's finally cleared up.

12:55.480 --> 12:56.880
It ends here.

13:04.480 --> 13:05.680
Tang Qi.

13:05.760 --> 13:07.360
Have you forgiven me?

13:07.440 --> 13:09.480
Does that mean you don't mind that
and you've forgiven me?

13:09.560 --> 13:11.800
You won't fire me?
Can I still go to work tomorrow?

13:12.760 --> 13:13.640
Tang Qi!

14:29.600 --> 14:31.600
I must've seen it wrong.

14:56.040 --> 14:58.320
I confessed to Tang Qi today.

14:58.400 --> 14:59.800
I apologized to him.

14:59.880 --> 15:01.960
It's my fault for hurting him.

15:02.040 --> 15:03.080
BESTIES

15:07.400 --> 15:10.920
You had to do it. Give yourself a break.

15:11.000 --> 15:12.320
YUAN

15:13.160 --> 15:14.480
What did Tang Qi say?

15:15.560 --> 15:17.840
He said he forgave me,

15:17.920 --> 15:20.480
but it seems he cried.

15:20.560 --> 15:21.760
What?

15:21.840 --> 15:23.720
Tang Qi's persona doesn't seem
the crying type.

15:23.800 --> 15:25.800
It's because he couldn't have you.

15:31.760 --> 15:34.880
He couldn't have me?

15:36.040 --> 15:37.760
Don't overthink it.

15:37.840 --> 15:39.640
How could Tang Qi fall in love with me?

15:41.840 --> 15:43.480
Alright, stop thinking about it.

15:43.560 --> 15:46.040
Since he said he forgave you,
then it's over.

15:47.440 --> 15:49.520
Go to sleep. You have to work tomorrow.

16:17.640 --> 16:18.680
Good morning, Mr. Tang.

16:19.400 --> 16:20.240
Good morning.

16:21.360 --> 16:23.920
Oh, I forgot to buy breakfast.
I'll go buy it.

16:25.320 --> 16:26.160
Come in.

16:31.840 --> 16:33.400
Wait, wait…

16:55.960 --> 16:57.400
The button on your back came off.

17:35.720 --> 17:37.120
There's a sewing kit at the front desk.

17:40.520 --> 17:41.360
Thank you.

17:49.640 --> 17:51.680
Xu Yue became a spy

17:51.760 --> 17:53.080
to get into Vandai.

17:53.680 --> 17:55.920
Director Zhang from Vandai has resigned.

17:56.000 --> 17:57.760
Xu Yue can't get into Vandai now.

17:57.840 --> 17:59.320
She…

17:59.400 --> 18:00.240
Come in.

18:01.640 --> 18:03.920
Enough. Xu Yue's matter ends here.

18:12.600 --> 18:15.200
This is our new perfume.
It's called White Pony.

18:15.280 --> 18:16.120
Try it.

18:17.560 --> 18:18.440
Thanks.

18:24.360 --> 18:25.760
TBC, WHITE PONY PERFUME

18:27.960 --> 18:30.160
- It smells so nice.
- This scent…

18:30.240 --> 18:32.280
It feels like I've smelled it before.

18:32.880 --> 18:35.320
It is indeed familiar,
as if I've smelled it before.

18:35.400 --> 18:36.960
It reminds me of the canna nectar

18:37.040 --> 18:39.840
I used to eat as a child.

18:42.600 --> 18:45.600
Mr. Gu, does White Pony
have any special meaning?

18:46.480 --> 18:48.800
This name was given by Mr. Tang.
He didn't explain.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.920
You can use your imagination
and interpret it freely.

18:52.000 --> 18:53.280
White Pony

18:53.880 --> 18:54.920
means a white horse.

18:55.000 --> 18:57.480
It should refer to a Prince Charming,

18:57.560 --> 19:00.360
symbolizing a young girl's
beautiful imagination about love.

19:00.440 --> 19:03.600
Our perfume smells sweet and romantic.

19:04.840 --> 19:08.160
A white horse doesn't necessarily mean
a Prince Charming.

19:08.240 --> 19:10.200
It could also be a white knight.

19:10.280 --> 19:11.640
It's brave and free,

19:11.720 --> 19:13.520
symbolizing that women can face life

19:13.600 --> 19:16.720
with courage to challenge
and freedom to enjoy.

19:17.800 --> 19:19.480
The white horse in the movie
The Eight Hundred

19:19.560 --> 19:20.880
symbolizes hope.

19:20.960 --> 19:24.200
Maybe Mr. Tang wants everyone
who uses this perfume

19:24.280 --> 19:26.160
to always have hope.

19:28.600 --> 19:30.240
The poem White Pony from The Book of Songs

19:30.320 --> 19:32.280
is a poem about parting
and cherishing friendships.

19:32.360 --> 19:34.960
White Pony can also symbolize
precious friendship.

19:35.040 --> 19:36.920
Now, everyone's friendships are in stages.

19:37.000 --> 19:40.200
Everyone we meet
can only accompany us for a while.

19:40.280 --> 19:42.200
Having one or two true friends

19:42.280 --> 19:43.400
always by your side

19:43.480 --> 19:45.320
is the fragrance of life,

19:45.400 --> 19:46.760
precious beyond words.

19:50.120 --> 19:51.680
Today's meeting ends here.

19:51.760 --> 19:53.360
Submit the proposal in three days.

19:53.440 --> 19:55.920
We will use the best one.

20:00.720 --> 20:02.000
Lilac.

20:02.960 --> 20:04.120
White orchid.

20:05.160 --> 20:06.680
Canna.

20:08.360 --> 20:09.480
Jasmine.

20:21.880 --> 20:23.600
I'll return to the palace.

20:23.680 --> 20:27.080
Goodbye, Your Highness.

20:44.160 --> 20:46.800
Chengcheng,
don't you like being a general?

20:47.560 --> 20:48.680
I do,

20:48.760 --> 20:51.880
but sometimes
I also want to be a princess.

20:51.960 --> 20:53.440
But they say

20:53.520 --> 20:56.000
princesses have to be very pretty,

20:56.080 --> 20:58.160
so only Qingli can be a princess.

21:00.520 --> 21:01.520
Come here, Chengcheng.

21:01.600 --> 21:02.960
Let me tell you.

21:03.920 --> 21:06.280
They were wrong.

21:06.360 --> 21:09.200
Qingli is the big princess,

21:09.280 --> 21:11.680
and you are the little princess.

21:11.760 --> 21:14.600
You're our family's little princess.

21:14.680 --> 21:17.040
Can I also become a little princess?

21:29.080 --> 21:30.080
So pretty.

21:30.160 --> 21:32.960
I've become a pretty little princess.

21:33.600 --> 21:35.240
The princess has arrived.

21:35.840 --> 21:38.080
The princess has arrived.

21:38.160 --> 21:40.040
The princess has arrived.

21:40.120 --> 21:42.760
The princess has arrived.

21:42.840 --> 21:44.280
The princess has arrived.

21:55.320 --> 21:58.080
I knew it. This scent is so familiar.

21:58.160 --> 22:01.520
When I was a child,
I often ate canna nectar with my friends.

22:01.600 --> 22:03.920
I also think it's familiar.

22:04.000 --> 22:06.000
When I was a kid,
my granny's house had a lilac tree.

22:06.080 --> 22:09.120
When the flowers bloomed,
even dreams smelled sweet.

22:12.440 --> 22:15.200
These are all common plant scents
from childhood.

22:15.840 --> 22:17.480
No wonder it feels familiar.

22:18.080 --> 22:20.360
It makes people recall the past.

22:35.760 --> 22:38.240
‪TBC

22:40.520 --> 22:42.320
Time has a scent,

22:43.280 --> 22:46.000
just like amber,
that can bring the past back.

22:52.400 --> 22:54.280
Wen, I need your help.

23:40.920 --> 23:43.480
Mr. Tang, your coat.

23:43.560 --> 23:44.920
Thank you for this morning.

23:46.200 --> 23:47.040
It's nothing.

24:01.720 --> 24:03.440
Mr. Tang, are you going out
to handle something?

24:08.120 --> 24:09.520
May it go smoothly.

24:12.720 --> 24:14.760
Oh, I forgot something.

24:14.840 --> 24:15.920
Mr. Tang, you go ahead.

24:43.960 --> 24:45.000
Coming.

24:45.080 --> 24:45.920
Try this.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.120
- Freshly made.
- Try one.

24:48.800 --> 24:50.200
- Delicious. Take a box.
- Is it good?

24:53.520 --> 24:55.640
We can't have something too sweet, right?

24:55.720 --> 24:57.440
Yes, they need low-sugar food.

24:58.240 --> 24:59.240
Try this.

25:02.160 --> 25:03.240
It's also good.

25:40.000 --> 25:40.840
Mr. Tang.

25:42.840 --> 25:43.680
Hello, Mr. Tang.

25:44.360 --> 25:45.200
Where are you?

25:45.280 --> 25:46.840
I'm working outside.

25:46.920 --> 25:47.760
What do you need?

25:50.840 --> 25:52.360
Are you sure you're working?

25:53.080 --> 25:54.480
Yes.

25:57.320 --> 25:58.160
What's up?

26:00.560 --> 26:01.400
Good.

26:04.960 --> 26:06.480
What's wrong with him now?

26:15.280 --> 26:16.320
Thank you.

26:19.000 --> 26:20.800
The grannies will definitely be happy.

26:20.880 --> 26:22.800
But I still don't understand.

26:22.880 --> 26:25.640
What does your company's product
have to do with senior citizens?

26:26.160 --> 26:27.680
You don't know this.

26:27.760 --> 26:29.760
There's a marketing method.

26:29.840 --> 26:31.480
It's about telling the product's story

26:31.560 --> 26:33.480
and selling the story's product.

26:43.840 --> 26:45.240
Are you jealous?

26:45.960 --> 26:46.800
No.

26:53.520 --> 26:55.000
I don't care

26:55.080 --> 26:56.760
who you had meals with.

26:56.840 --> 26:57.760
What I care about

26:57.840 --> 26:59.880
is you're lying.

27:05.800 --> 27:09.040
I lied because I didn't want you
to get mad over a meal.

27:10.120 --> 27:12.240
This male lead is so awkward.

27:12.320 --> 27:14.640
He clearly is jealous but won't admit it.

27:15.640 --> 27:17.320
What would you do if it were you?

27:23.320 --> 27:24.800
Can I refuse to answer

27:25.560 --> 27:26.600
a tricky question like this?

27:27.960 --> 27:30.560
You promised to help me
collect inspirational materials.

27:37.640 --> 27:40.520
Honesty is the most effective way
of communication.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.760
I'd say

27:46.080 --> 27:47.400
I'm jealous.

27:47.480 --> 27:49.600
I do mind that you had a meal

27:49.680 --> 27:51.520
with the man who has a crush on you.

27:52.600 --> 27:54.520
But to save Grandpa's farm,

27:54.600 --> 27:56.440
I have to go eat
with the Silver Carp Demon.

27:58.560 --> 27:59.400
As expected,

27:59.480 --> 28:02.680
the other one won't like it
no matter what.

28:02.760 --> 28:04.600
There's still going to be a fight.

28:05.200 --> 28:07.960
JIANLE NURSING HOME

28:26.160 --> 28:27.600
Granny, have some water.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.680
Thank you.

28:30.560 --> 28:31.400
Let me do it.

28:33.080 --> 28:34.240
You take care of this box.

28:40.720 --> 28:41.800
Try one.

28:42.720 --> 28:43.760
You're such a glutton.

28:44.840 --> 28:45.960
Greet them.

28:46.040 --> 28:47.240
Grandpas, Grannies,

28:47.320 --> 28:48.960
we've prepared free pastries
for you today.

28:49.040 --> 28:50.040
Come and have a look.

28:52.800 --> 28:53.920
Free?

28:54.000 --> 28:55.200
Yes, it's free.

28:55.280 --> 28:56.320
- Try one.
- Try one.

28:56.400 --> 28:58.000
- Try one. It's tasty.
- I'll try one.

28:58.960 --> 29:00.120
This one's rose.

29:00.200 --> 29:02.240
- That's red bean.
- Red bean?

29:02.320 --> 29:03.240
Red bean.

29:03.320 --> 29:05.400
- Sure.
- How is it? Is it good?

29:05.480 --> 29:06.320
It's good.

29:09.200 --> 29:12.000
This is our company's
newly developed perfume.

29:12.080 --> 29:13.880
Each lady can take a small bottle.

29:14.520 --> 29:15.360
Here.

29:17.200 --> 29:18.120
Take it.

29:18.760 --> 29:19.920
Here.

29:24.680 --> 29:27.560
You're giving us food for no reason,

29:27.640 --> 29:28.720
and even perfume?

29:28.800 --> 29:32.800
Are you trying to sell the perfume to us?

29:32.880 --> 29:34.040
No, Granny.

29:34.120 --> 29:36.080
This is a free sample.

29:36.160 --> 29:37.760
I just wanted to come and chat with you.

29:37.840 --> 29:39.480
This isn't better

29:39.560 --> 29:41.760
than toilet water that's much cheaper.

29:42.400 --> 29:43.280
Miss,

29:43.880 --> 29:45.560
you should give this to someone else.

29:45.640 --> 29:47.680
We're old now.

29:47.760 --> 29:49.280
No need for us to smell nice.

29:49.360 --> 29:51.320
Others will just laugh at us

29:51.400 --> 29:53.240
for dressing up at such an old age.

29:53.840 --> 29:55.080
Exactly.

29:55.160 --> 29:56.720
I can't stand to use it.

29:57.320 --> 29:58.560
Here.

30:07.400 --> 30:09.200
Granny Lin. The pastry is too sweet.

30:09.280 --> 30:10.560
You can't eat too much. It's unhealthy.

30:12.600 --> 30:15.040
We can't eat anymore? Boring. Let's go.

30:16.160 --> 30:18.920
Granny, how about we play a game?

30:19.000 --> 30:19.920
It'll be fun.

30:20.000 --> 30:22.000
A game? What kind of game?

30:23.160 --> 30:24.400
What game?

30:28.040 --> 30:29.600
This is an old problem.

30:29.680 --> 30:31.560
It'll get better in a few days.

30:32.160 --> 30:34.120
Another potted plant?

30:34.840 --> 30:37.480
My illness won't get better soon then.

30:40.640 --> 30:42.480
People usually send flowers to patients.

30:42.560 --> 30:44.400
Who sends potted plants?

30:44.480 --> 30:47.480
Chinese people avoid this as it may hint
the disease will be rooted.

30:50.880 --> 30:51.720
I…

30:54.480 --> 30:55.800
I think it's more practical

30:55.880 --> 30:57.680
and you can keep appreciating it,

30:58.280 --> 30:59.120
so I bought it.

30:59.200 --> 31:00.840
Teacher, sorry.

31:01.560 --> 31:04.840
But you brought delicious pastry.

31:05.560 --> 31:07.160
I'll keep this.

31:07.240 --> 31:09.520
As for the potted plant,

31:09.600 --> 31:10.640
you can take it when you leave.

31:11.160 --> 31:12.000
Alright.

31:14.840 --> 31:17.680
Teacher, this is our new perfume sample.

31:34.920 --> 31:36.480
The top notes are rich,

31:37.120 --> 31:38.520
and the fragrance is elegant.

31:40.640 --> 31:41.760
It wouldn't be easy.

31:41.840 --> 31:43.120
How did you manage it?

31:45.000 --> 31:46.840
Apart from the choice of ingredients,

31:46.920 --> 31:48.760
we also used intermolecular forces

31:48.840 --> 31:52.400
to change the evaporation time
of several volatile molecules

31:52.480 --> 31:54.040
to create a sense of layering.

31:56.120 --> 31:57.560
It feels familiar,

31:58.640 --> 32:00.200
bringing up memories.

32:01.320 --> 32:02.480
It's like going back to the past.

32:05.480 --> 32:07.600
The concept behind this perfume

32:07.680 --> 32:09.280
is the Proust Effect.

32:12.640 --> 32:14.240
Visual memory

32:14.320 --> 32:15.920
starts to fade

32:16.000 --> 32:17.440
in four months at most,

32:18.840 --> 32:21.800
but olfactory memory is eternal.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.800
The familiar scent

32:23.880 --> 32:27.800
awakens the deepest memories
in the hippocampus.

32:27.880 --> 32:29.000
Looks like

32:29.080 --> 32:31.520
you want to create a perfume

32:31.600 --> 32:33.560
that can awaken memories.

32:37.720 --> 32:40.920
Even if time passes and years go by,

32:41.480 --> 32:43.040
as long as memories remain,

32:43.120 --> 32:44.560
the fragrance will stay in your mind.

32:46.680 --> 32:50.040
This perfume holds
time that cannot be returned.

32:50.120 --> 32:53.320
It should be very popular.

32:57.400 --> 32:58.760
But I still haven't figured out

32:59.680 --> 33:01.400
how to present this concept.

33:02.200 --> 33:04.720
JIANLE NURSING HOME

33:05.600 --> 33:09.200
Fate brings couples from far away

33:09.280 --> 33:12.760
And drives strangers away nearby

33:12.840 --> 33:16.080
It took us ten years
To be on the same boat

33:16.160 --> 33:19.880
And 100 years to share one pillow

33:19.960 --> 33:23.480
If there's fate in a thousand years…

33:23.560 --> 33:25.920
Wang Yi, thanks for your help.

33:26.000 --> 33:27.480
You're very welcome.

33:27.560 --> 33:29.480
When I need your help,
just come at any time.

33:29.560 --> 33:31.120
Of course, I'll be ready anytime.

33:31.200 --> 33:32.520
Is it done?

33:32.600 --> 33:33.840
If you can't get it done, we'll leave.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.440
It's almost ready.

33:35.520 --> 33:38.480
At our age, we don't have time to waste.

33:39.360 --> 33:40.480
Chengcheng, is it ready?

33:40.560 --> 33:41.520
Almost.

33:42.680 --> 33:43.520
Ready.

33:45.880 --> 33:47.040
It's your photo.

33:47.120 --> 33:48.840
What's so special about it? Boring.

33:48.920 --> 33:49.800
Boring.

33:49.880 --> 33:51.040
Exactly. We're all here.

33:51.120 --> 33:53.600
- What's so special about photos?
- Exactly.

33:55.600 --> 33:58.760
AT THE AGE OF

33:58.840 --> 34:00.480
Hey. Look.

34:00.560 --> 34:05.000
AT THE AGE OF

34:19.920 --> 34:22.000
AT THE AGE OF

34:22.080 --> 34:25.120
AT THE AGE OF 20

34:27.120 --> 34:28.040
So young.

34:28.120 --> 34:29.320
That's right.

34:29.400 --> 34:31.199
When I was 20, I was like this.

34:31.280 --> 34:32.960
How about that? I wasn't lying to you.

34:33.679 --> 34:34.920
Back then,

34:35.000 --> 34:37.960
I was the beauty of our textile factory.

34:38.639 --> 34:40.159
To put it in the words of today's youth,

34:40.239 --> 34:41.880
I was the factory beauty.

34:42.480 --> 34:45.000
- The factory beauty.
- You're indeed the factory beauty.

34:45.080 --> 34:46.560
Unfortunately, back then,

34:46.639 --> 34:48.280
my family wasn't well off.

34:48.360 --> 34:51.239
I was the eldest, so I rarely took photos.

34:51.320 --> 34:52.400
I never thought

34:52.480 --> 34:55.840
I'd get to see myself from my youth again.

34:57.800 --> 34:58.680
How nice.

35:05.040 --> 35:06.320
Granny Shi, look.

35:07.840 --> 35:09.160
So beautiful.

35:09.240 --> 35:10.920
So young.

35:11.000 --> 35:11.840
Twenty years old.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.640
- So beautiful.
- So lovely.

35:13.720 --> 35:14.680
Who else wants to see

35:14.760 --> 35:16.320
what they looked like
when they were young?

35:16.400 --> 35:17.240
I want to try it.

35:17.320 --> 35:20.080
I wasn't bad-looking when I was young.

35:20.160 --> 35:21.000
Give me one too.

35:21.080 --> 35:22.400
Sure, we'll all take a look later.

35:22.480 --> 35:24.120
- Let me try it.
- Let's all try.

35:24.200 --> 35:25.800
- Everyone can try it.
- We'll all try.

35:26.880 --> 35:28.680
Granny, yours.

35:29.480 --> 35:30.840
- Take a look.
- Yours.

35:31.640 --> 35:33.960
You were really cute when you were young.

35:34.040 --> 35:36.360
You were pretty too.

35:36.440 --> 35:37.360
Miss,

35:38.040 --> 35:39.040
thank you so much.

35:39.680 --> 35:42.200
As an old woman,

35:42.280 --> 35:43.400
I've forgotten

35:43.480 --> 35:47.640
how charming I used to be.

35:48.240 --> 35:49.760
Granny, you're still charming now.

35:49.840 --> 35:51.000
Yo!

36:11.320 --> 36:12.160
Granny,

36:12.720 --> 36:14.440
could you show me that?

36:21.840 --> 36:23.040
This…

36:48.000 --> 36:49.920
AT THE AGE OF 23

36:55.240 --> 36:57.080
Her husband was so good to her,

36:57.680 --> 37:01.360
but he passed away young.

37:01.440 --> 37:03.720
She never remarried in her life.

37:03.800 --> 37:07.360
She carried this photo everywhere.

37:07.440 --> 37:10.080
AT THE AGE OF 23

37:28.560 --> 37:32.480
AT THE AGE OF

37:44.920 --> 37:48.840
AT THE AGE OF 67

37:50.440 --> 37:53.280
So, he'd look like this

37:53.360 --> 37:54.320
if he had grown old.

37:55.560 --> 37:57.600
I thought I'd never

37:57.680 --> 38:01.120
see him looking like an old man.

38:14.120 --> 38:15.320
Granny…

38:23.880 --> 38:27.800
We promised to grow old together.

38:39.200 --> 38:40.160
Sorry.

38:42.000 --> 38:44.120
Thank you.

38:53.000 --> 38:54.440
This scent…

39:08.680 --> 39:09.520
Hello, Grannies.

39:15.440 --> 39:16.680
What brings Mr. Tang here?

39:17.360 --> 39:19.360
I happened to run into Mr. Tang
when I was leaving the company,

39:19.960 --> 39:21.560
so I told him I was coming here.

39:24.800 --> 39:25.640
Granny,

39:26.720 --> 39:27.560
this is for you.

39:39.040 --> 39:40.600
It feels like I'm back in the past.

39:42.880 --> 39:45.720
He said he couldn't afford a ring for me,

39:46.560 --> 39:48.560
so he made me a bouquet instead.

39:50.880 --> 39:51.800
Thank you.

39:51.880 --> 39:53.080
You're welcome.

39:56.320 --> 39:58.320
I love white orchids.

39:58.400 --> 39:59.880
In the summer,

39:59.960 --> 40:03.000
a bunch of us young girls
would string white orchids

40:03.080 --> 40:05.120
with a fine thread

40:05.200 --> 40:06.320
and hang them around our necks.

40:06.400 --> 40:08.600
We'd smell so sweet wherever we went.

40:10.080 --> 40:11.960
I love lilacs.

40:12.040 --> 40:13.680
When I worked the night shift,

40:14.280 --> 40:15.520
my husband would ride his bike

40:16.040 --> 40:19.280
to pick me up every time I got off work.

40:19.880 --> 40:22.120
The roads were damp,

40:22.880 --> 40:25.520
and they smelled of lilacs.

40:26.200 --> 40:27.640
I like that too.

40:27.720 --> 40:28.760
So fragrant.

40:28.840 --> 40:30.640
Those were the good times.

40:30.720 --> 40:32.040
- Granny.
- Exactly.

40:32.120 --> 40:33.760
Please smell this fragrance.

40:35.040 --> 40:37.960
The perfume is for young people,
not for us.

40:39.800 --> 40:41.480
- Yes.
- Right.

40:42.120 --> 40:45.480
Granny,
the love for beauty has no age limit.

40:45.560 --> 40:46.720
Even as time goes by,

40:46.800 --> 40:48.520
those wonderful memories,

40:48.600 --> 40:50.480
just like the fragrance of these flowers,

40:50.560 --> 40:52.480
are memories that can't be taken away.

40:52.560 --> 40:54.960
Young people can wear it,
and so can grannies.

41:00.240 --> 41:03.080
Some women stand out

41:03.160 --> 41:04.360
because of their courage.

41:04.440 --> 41:07.920
Some shine with their kindness.

41:08.000 --> 41:11.160
And some women shine with their wisdom.

41:11.240 --> 41:13.640
There are many kinds of beauty
in this world.

41:17.680 --> 41:18.560
For customers,

41:18.640 --> 41:21.760
there is no second-best, only the best.

41:29.760 --> 41:31.480
Why don't we give it a try?

41:31.560 --> 41:33.520
Have a try. Let me help you.

41:33.600 --> 41:34.760
Come on. Let me try it.

41:34.840 --> 41:37.360
Granny, give me your hand.

41:39.640 --> 41:40.520
Smell it.

41:40.600 --> 41:41.560
Give it a try.

41:42.120 --> 41:43.320
Let's see if it smells good.

41:58.800 --> 42:00.120
It feels like I'm back on the road

42:00.200 --> 42:02.440
with my husband riding home with me.

42:03.440 --> 42:05.360
I'll spray a bit more for you then.

42:05.440 --> 42:07.160
The lilac sea.

42:08.280 --> 42:09.400
It's so fragrant.

42:23.440 --> 42:26.360
You just said this perfume was free for us

42:26.440 --> 42:28.320
and you wanted to chat with us.

42:28.400 --> 42:29.480
What do you want to talk about?

42:29.560 --> 42:30.440
Whatever you want is fine.

42:30.520 --> 42:31.680
- Yes.
- Anything you want.

42:31.760 --> 42:32.680
Let's chat over there.

42:33.280 --> 42:35.120
We can talk about anything
if you don't mind.

42:35.200 --> 42:36.160
- How could I mind?
- OK.

42:36.240 --> 42:38.600
I'm happy to chat with you.

42:38.680 --> 42:40.360
- Let's go, Granny.
- Let's go.
